{"type":"standard","title":"Harriet Hageman","displaytitle":"<span lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><span class=\"mw-page-title-main\">Harriet Hageman</span></span>","namespace":{"id":0,"text":""},"wikibase_item":"Q110815967","titles":{"canonical":"Harriet_Hageman","normalized":"Harriet Hageman","display":"<span lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><span class=\"mw-page-title-main\">Harriet Hageman</span></span>"},"pageid":68675857,"thumbnail":{"source":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/2/2f/Official-harriet-hageman-wy00.jpg/330px-Official-harriet-hageman-wy00.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","width":330,"height":413},"originalimage":{"source":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/2/2f/Official-harriet-hageman-wy00.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled","width":3360,"height":4200},"lang":"en","dir":"ltr","revision":"1377792579","tid":"a180d479-bd4a-11f1-be4e-404ba47f1550","timestamp":"2026-10-01T03:46:06Z","description":"American politician (born 1962)","description_source":"local","content_urls":{"desktop":{"page":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Harriet_Hageman","revisions":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Harriet_Hageman?action=history","edit":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Harriet_Hageman?action=edit","talk":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Talk:Harriet_Hageman"},"mobile":{"page":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Harriet_Hageman","revisions":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Special:History/Harriet_Hageman","edit":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Harriet_Hageman?action=edit","talk":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Talk:Harriet_Hageman"}},"extract":"Harriet Maxine Hageman is an American politician and attorney serving as the U.S. representative for Wyoming's at-large congressional district since 2023. She is the Republican nominee for the 2026 United States Senate election in Wyoming, seeking to succeed incumbent Cynthia Lummis.","extract_html":"<p><b>Harriet Maxine Hageman</b> is an American politician and attorney serving as the U.S. representative for Wyoming's at-large congressional district since 2023. She is the Republican nominee for the 2026 United States Senate election in Wyoming, seeking to succeed incumbent Cynthia Lummis.</p>"}